Kadogo and Juma are best friends who love running. They run together every day. One day at school, they looked at maps. Juma said, “Let’s run across our continent and race with friends from many places!” Kadogo shouted, “Let’s go! We can do it! African unity!” They carried a torch. They lit it and started running.

